# Bulk catalog exports. Large, regenerable, and not source.
data/

# Local product catalog working files. Large and regenerable.
#
# **Anchored, and it has to be.** Unanchored, `products/` matches a directory
# of that name at *any* depth — which silently excluded
# `apps/web/app/api/v1/catalog/products/`, the API routes for the catalog. The
# two routes already committed when this rule arrived stayed tracked, because
# gitignore does not affect tracked files, so nothing looked wrong; the next
# route added under that path was never committed, deployed as a 404, and
# reached the browser as an HTML error page that a `response.json()` choked on.
/products/
